  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Place potato fries on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the fries between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d667a5a49c635d8ad503/step-6fb97d00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice cucumber into half-moons.\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• Thinly slice apple (see ingredients) into wedges.\n• In a large bowl, combine cucumber, apple, slaw mix, a drizzle of the vinegar and half the plant-based smokey aioli. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d667a5a49c635d8ad503/step-658a9b10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When fries have 10 minutes remaining, in a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d667a5a49c635d8ad503/step-0ae15a20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide plant-based chick'n tenders, haloumi, cucumber slaw and herby fries between plates.\n• Serve with remaining plant-based smokey aioli. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d667a5a49c635d8ad503/step-218c8230.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
